    "body": "Charlie can correct me here but I think we are already [resetting some states](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:content/browser/renderer_host/navigation_request.cc;l=1889;drc=6531e02635a3f00784aacad5c641cd16532657e5) for cross-SiteInstance redirects in Chrome. So probably changing a navigation from same-document to cross-document is doable after a cross-origin navigation is doable as well (currently cross/same-document classification is determined and fixed [at the start of navigation](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:content/browser/renderer_host/navigation_controller_impl.cc;l=380;drc=6531e02635a3f00784aacad5c641cd16532657e5))",
